    "group": "Captain in Phobos Armour",
    "summary": "Each battle round, the Phobos Captain’s unit can make one of these moves. If it shoots in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) and is **[Unengaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)**, it can move up to D6″ with a **[Normal Move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move)**. If **[Engaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)** when the opposing [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) closes, it can use a **[Fall-Back Move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)** to travel up to 6″.",
